    "text": "kqennewsradio.com\nwebsite\nRoseburg\nTWO DRIVERS TAKEN TO HOSPITAL, FOLLOWING TWO-VEHICLE WRECK\n11 hours ago\nTwo drivers were taken to the hospital, following a two-vehicle wreck on Tuesday afternoon. A Roseburg Police report said at 3:30 p.m. a 39-year-old man was driving east on Northeast Diamond Lake Boulevard near the intersection of Northeast Garrecht Avenue. A 30-year-old man was at the intersection and reportedly pulled out into traffic, right in front of the first vehicle.",
